{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34426","headline":"寄茅山何威仪二首 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"寄茅山何威仪二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大小三峰次九华，灵踪今尽属何家。\n汉时仙上云巅鹤，蜀地春开洞底花。\n闲傍积岚寻瀑眼，便凌残雪探芝芽。\n年来已奉黄庭教，夕链腥魂晓吸霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}